#, fuzzy
msgid ""
msgstr ""#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:1
msgid "Cube 算子开发"
msgstr "Cube Operator Development"

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:3
msgid ""
"Cube 算子以矩阵乘或批量矩阵乘为主要计算负载，Triton 代码中通常以 `tl.dot` 为核心。Cube 算子的关键是围绕 M/N/K "
"三个维度设计 tile，使 A/B tile 能高效搬运到片上并在 Cube Core 上完成累加。"
msgstr "Cube operators use matrix multiplication or batched matrix multiplication as the main workload. In Triton code, the core operation is usually `tl.dot`. The main task is to design M/N/K tiles so that A and B tiles can be moved on chip efficiently and accumulated on Cube Cores."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:5
msgid "Cube 简单算子开发"
msgstr "Simple Cube Operator Development"

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:7
msgid ""
"简单 Cube 算子可参考本仓 [矩阵乘法样例](../examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md)"
" 或 `third_party/ascend/tutorials/03-matrix-multiplication.py`。一个最小开发路径包括："
msgstr "For a simple Cube operator, refer to the [Matrix Multiplication example](../examples/05_matrix_multiplication_example.md) or `third_party/ascend/tutorials/03-matrix-multiplication.py`."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:9
msgid "明确输入输出 shape 和 stride，例如 `A[M, K]`、`B[K, N]`、`C[M, N]`。"
msgstr "1. Define input/output shapes and strides, for example `A[M, K]`, `B[K, N]`, and `C[M, N]`."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:10
msgid "用 `tl.program_id` 映射当前 program 到输出矩阵的 `(pid_m, pid_n)` tile。"
msgstr "2. Map `tl.program_id` to the output tile `(pid_m, pid_n)`."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:11
msgid "用 `BLOCK_SIZE_M/N/K` 构造 A/B 的二维偏移。"
msgstr "3. Build 2D offsets for A and B using `BLOCK_SIZE_M/N/K`."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:12
msgid "沿 K 维循环加载 A/B 子块，并用 `tl.dot` 累加到 fp32 accumulator。"
msgstr "4. Loop over K, load A/B sub-blocks, and accumulate with `tl.dot` in fp32."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:13
msgid "将 accumulator 转为输出 dtype，并用边界 mask 写回 C。"
msgstr "5. Cast the accumulator to the output dtype and store with boundary masks."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:15
msgid "核心结构如下："
msgstr "Core structure is as follows:"

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:46
msgid "简单 Cube 算子调参时优先关注："
msgstr "When tuning simple Cube operators, check the following first:"

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:48
msgid "`BLOCK_M/N/K` 是否满足硬件支持和 UB/L1 容量限制。"
msgstr "Whether `BLOCK_M/N/K` meets hardware support and UB/L1 capacity limits."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:49
msgid "K 维循环是否可以开启 `multibuffer` 以形成搬运和计算流水。"
msgstr "Whether the K loop can enable `multibuffer` to pipeline data movement and computation."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:50
msgid ""
"输出 tile 是否包含额外 bias、scale、activation。如果后处理很轻，可以仍归为 Cube 算子；如果后处理包含明显 "
"Vector 归约或跨核同步，应按 CV 融合算子组织。"
msgstr "Whether the output tile includes extra bias, scale, or activation. If the post-processing is lightweight, it can still be classified as a Cube operator; if it involves significant Vector reduction or cross-core synchronization, organize it as a CV fusion operator."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:52
msgid "Cube 复杂算子开发"
msgstr "Complex Cube Operator Development"

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:54
msgid ""
"复杂 Cube 场景通常来自 attention、batched matmul、grouped matmul 或形状不规则的矩阵乘。当前 "
"[Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops) "
"主分支的复杂案例集中在 `tutorial/best_practice/`，其中 "
"[`002-decode_grouped_attention.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-"
"ascend-"
"ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py) "
"可以作为复杂 Cube 核心逻辑的参考：它包含 QK、PV 两段 `tl.dot`，并展示了 KV cache 离散索引下如何重组 K/V 访存。"
msgstr "Complex Cube cases often come from attention, batched matmul, grouped matmul, or irregular shapes. In the current main branch of [Ascend/triton-ascend-ops](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops), complex cases are mainly in `tutorial/best_practice/`. [`002-decode_grouped_attention.py`](https://github.com/Ascend/triton-ascend-ops/blob/main/tutorial/best_practice/002-decode_grouped_attention.py) is a useful reference for the Cube core because it contains QK and PV `tl.dot` stages and shows how to reorganize K/V memory access under discrete KV-cache indices."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:56
msgid "复杂 Cube 算子建议按以下顺序拆解："
msgstr "Complex Cube operators should be decomposed in the following order:"

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:58
msgid "**先抽出纯矩阵乘核心**：确认每次 `tl.dot` 的输入 tile shape、dtype、累加 dtype 和输出 tile shape。"
msgstr "1. **Extract the pure matmul core first**: Confirm the input tile shape, dtype, accumulator dtype, and output tile shape for each `tl.dot`."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:59
msgid ""
"**再处理不规则访存**：如果 K/V cache 低维离散、高维连续，直接二维 load 可能退化为标量访存。可先按连续维搬入 "
"UB，再通过转置或 `tl.insert_slice` 重组为 `tl.dot` 需要的布局。"
msgstr "2. **Handle irregular memory access next**: If K/V cache is discrete in the low dimension and continuous in the high dimension, direct 2D load may degrade to scalar access. Load by continuous dimension into UB first, then reorganize into the layout required by `tl.dot` via transpose or `tl.insert_slice`."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:60
msgid ""
"**把归约和归一化留到边界明确的位置**：例如 attention 中的 `max/sum/exp` 属于 Vector 逻辑，若和 "
"`tl.dot` 放在同一 kernel，需要转到 [CV 融合算子开发](./cv_fusion_operator.md) 的思路。"
msgstr "3. **Leave reductions and normalization to well-defined boundaries**: For example, `max/sum/exp` in attention belongs to Vector logic. If placed in the same kernel as `tl.dot`, refer to [CV Fusion Operator Development](./cv_fusion_operator.md)."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:61
msgid ""
"**为长 K 或长序列设计内层循环**：K 维循环要控制单次 A/B tile 的片上占用；序列维循环要避免一次 load 过大的 K/V "
"block。"
msgstr "4. **Design inner loops for long K or long sequences**: The K loop should control the on-chip usage of each A/B tile; the sequence loop should avoid loading an overly large K/V block at once."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:62
msgid ""
"**用 Autotune 管理候选 tile**：为常见 shape 准备多组 `BLOCK_M/N/K` 和 `multibuffer` "
"配置，让运行时选择最优组合。"
msgstr "5. **Use Autotune to manage candidate tiles**: Prepare multiple `BLOCK_M/N/K` and `multibuffer` configurations for common shapes, letting the runtime select the optimal combination."

#: ../../zh/programming_guide/cube_operator.md:64
msgid ""
"复杂 Cube 算子的常见风险是把 GPU 上的大量 program 直接迁移到 NPU。若输出 tile 数远大于物理 Cube Core "
"数，可考虑让每个 program 通过内层循环处理多个 tile，或者在确认逻辑核相互独立时设置 "
"`TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL=1` 降低调度开销。"
msgstr "A common migration risk is directly keeping a GPU-style large grid. If the output tile count is far larger than the physical Cube Core count, let each program process multiple tiles in an inner loop, or set `TRITON_ALL_BLOCKS_PARALLEL=1` when logical programs are independent."
